pseudo-Boolean proof version 3.0
% Positive companion to
% incorrect/version3/opb_two_constraints_on_one_line: the same two constraints,
% one per line as the format requires, with an honest refutation.
%
% The formula is unsatisfiable, which is the point: written on one line the
% second constraint was dropped and the remainder verified as satisfiable.
% Written correctly, the two add to the empty contradiction.
f 2;
pol 1 2 +;
output NONE;
conclusion UNSAT : -1;
end pseudo-Boolean proof;
